#
# Slim E2E +2: LaneStudioTests (#650) -- a lane task with its own assignee says
# "this task's own settings" and NOT "the lane"; a task in a group-less lane
# says "No assignment yet".
#
# FLOWABLE +3: MultiPoolPublishRefusalTests (#645) -- a pool with nothing in it
